                    {
                        "form_id": "2323cab2-aa57-463f-b627-248284a08967",
                        "entry_id": "4ec69b2a-6d17-35d6-8653-d5e4f33c2578",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "жме́нях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0864e10b-aebe-3255-903f-5444fe2ec25a",
                        "entry_id": "4ec69b2a-6d17-35d6-8653-d5e4f33c2578",
                        "glosses": [
                            "прост., рег. ладонь с пальцами, согнутыми так, чтобы ими можно было зачерпнуть, захватить или удержать что-либо насыпанное, положенное"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "654c4231-f6b1-49f4-a25b-3a776cbd7df6",
                                "sense_id": "0864e10b-aebe-3255-903f-5444fe2ec25a",
                                "text": "Она быстро сбросила туфли, надетые на босу ногу, и, подхватив в узкую загорелую жменю подол темной юбки, смело вошла в воду."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9dabc748-d1f4-3554-acf3-e66375ebafc7",
                        "entry_id": "4ec69b2a-6d17-35d6-8653-d5e4f33c2578",
                        "glosses": [
                            "количество чего-либо, вмещающееся в сложенную таким образом ладонь"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "30010ae3-43c5-4adc-bea1-de06be7a22c2",
                                "sense_id": "9dabc748-d1f4-3554-acf3-e66375ebafc7",
                                "text": "Помимо них, он показал ей еще жменю драгоценных камней: изумрудов, сапфиров и рубинов."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3f2eecd0-7d1e-4785-bf8f-5e2e3aa38894",
                        "source_entry_id": "4ec69b2a-6d17-35d6-8653-d5e4f33c2578",
                        "source_sense_description": "количество, умещающееся в ладони",
                        "target_lang_word": "handful",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "handful",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b3bfd68a-18cc-3ce6-9e26-3821c395c99f",
                                        "entry_id": "dc0fbabb-ced5-353a-a963-5558d7196813",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The amount that a hand will grasp or contain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "554eb19f-7027-4a55-8303-5eb7b572ac24",
                                                "sense_id": "b3bfd68a-18cc-3ce6-9e26-3821c395c99f",
                                                "text": "I put two or three corns in my mouth, liked it, stole a handful, went into my chamber, chewed it, and for two months after never failed taking toll of every pennyworth of oatmeal that came into the house: […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33ec2ede-0612-323c-880e-db0b91b3c3d0",
                                        "entry_id": "dc0fbabb-ced5-353a-a963-5558d7196813",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A hand's breadth; four inches."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da290aec-75e1-4891-b5e8-cae4a0f39f56",
                                                "sense_id": "33ec2ede-0612-323c-880e-db0b91b3c3d0",
                                                "text": "Knap the tongs together about a handful from the bottom."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "21cd8b90-1345-3a0e-9927-0ec90a6d3f31",
                                        "entry_id": "dc0fbabb-ced5-353a-a963-5558d7196813",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small number, usually approximately five."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2602109a-e928-49d0-86e6-7d441ba7cdc2",
                                                "sense_id": "21cd8b90-1345-3a0e-9927-0ec90a6d3f31",
                                                "text": "This handful of men were tied to very hard duty."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5b03e0f-e0a7-45a3-883f-4ef5d981db8b",
                                                "sense_id": "21cd8b90-1345-3a0e-9927-0ec90a6d3f31",
                                                "text": "The names of a number of the most famous North American railroads could be found in the north-east; Pennsylvania, New York Central, Baltimore & Ohio, Chesapeake & Ohio, and the Norfolk & Western, to name but a handful."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4317364-65dd-4ae8-961e-b4cdd5e47404",
                                                "sense_id": "21cd8b90-1345-3a0e-9927-0ec90a6d3f31",
                                                "text": "Was it deliberate that the first week of October 1961 was chosen to conduct a national survey of passenger usage? Why October of all months, when the holiday season was over and families back at work and at school? Was this a fiddling of the figures to make an unfair case against rail-dependent resorts such as those in the West Country, Norfolk, Lincolnshire and East Yorkshire, where previously overloaded summer services would now only have a handful of locals on board?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "56651023-76bc-3974-a58e-e797dad63074",
                                        "entry_id": "dc0fbabb-ced5-353a-a963-5558d7196813",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A group or number of things; a bunch."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d31ef40d-89a5-4ca8-8166-da4023be20db",
                                                "sense_id": "56651023-76bc-3974-a58e-e797dad63074",
                                                "text": "But, aunt, she must have had some kind of education, her accent was so pure, her English so unfaulty. The other girl dropped her h's by handfuls, and made some very wild confusion in her native etymology."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50f6e12a-d75f-3f5b-840a-5728faa2d3b0",
                                        "entry_id": "dc0fbabb-ced5-353a-a963-5558d7196813",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something which can only be managed with difficulty."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5f782c0-a303-435b-9b62-ce9280a29dd9",
                                                "sense_id": "50f6e12a-d75f-3f5b-840a-5728faa2d3b0",
                                                "text": "Those twins are a real handful to look after."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc1b65d4-9a1d-415f-92b0-9131db29516e",
                                                "sense_id": "50f6e12a-d75f-3f5b-840a-5728faa2d3b0",
                                                "text": "The Southern acquired them because the little Class \"B4\" 0-4-0 tanks were finding heavy modern rolling stock more and more of a handful, and at war's end the railway had nothing of suitable power but short wheelbase on its books to take their place on the more tortuous of the dock lines."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77afb431-d5a0-46c7-ae2e-ba9f77a9906a",
                                                "sense_id": "50f6e12a-d75f-3f5b-840a-5728faa2d3b0",
                                                "text": "Many times dogs are surrendered for reasons such as changes in the family unit, a death in the family, no time to care for a dog, or because that cute little puppy is now a 100 lb untrained handful."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "212b8446-92d5-336a-ab62-3aa49dcf5bd1",
                                        "entry_id": "dc0fbabb-ced5-353a-a963-5558d7196813",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A five-year prison sentence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "809df007-c02c-4b5c-8ca3-0f4b991890b2",
                        "source_entry_id": "4ec69b2a-6d17-35d6-8653-d5e4f33c2578",
                        "source_sense_description": "количество, умещающееся в ладони",
                        "target_lang_word": "poignée",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "poignée",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "25d76d92-1de7-37b3-b889-27cfef131fe0",
                                        "entry_id": "42fce56c-d864-319c-a71d-d219933d53bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Quantité de matière qu’on peut prendre dans une main."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03bb0582-7c90-4b41-a66b-59472c2f1eb0",
                                                "sense_id": "25d76d92-1de7-37b3-b889-27cfef131fe0",
                                                "text": "Pendant ce temps, le capitaine avait mis sur le bureau une bouteille alléchante et deux gobelets ainsi qu'une poignée de graines de cardamome."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ee15d49-c2da-4a7d-bdee-79f67888fe04",
                                                "sense_id": "25d76d92-1de7-37b3-b889-27cfef131fe0",
                                                "text": "Tout le monde se servit, même Tauno, qui se leva laborieusement du canapé et prit toute une poignée de grignoteries dans le sachet d’Irma."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ec888904-8ba2-30eb-90dc-c95ecfa98749",
                                        "entry_id": "42fce56c-d864-319c-a71d-d219933d53bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Petit nombre de personnes ou de choses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "985b42ec-31da-4cb8-82ce-193ca09f6975",
                                                "sense_id": "ec888904-8ba2-30eb-90dc-c95ecfa98749",
                                                "text": "Pour changer d’atmosphère, le bateau libère des poignées de croisiéristes dès son arrivée, pressés par le temps pour visiter La Rochelle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0ad76cb-5144-444d-9bda-bbd53ed07036",
                                                "sense_id": "ec888904-8ba2-30eb-90dc-c95ecfa98749",
                                                "text": "Les morts, du côté de Versailles furent une infime poignée dont chacun eut des milliers de victimes, immolées à ses mânes ; du côté de la Commune les victimes furent sans nom et sans nombre ; […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5d00c68-a1c9-4ea3-85e2-1ef7148b2c15",
                                                "sense_id": "ec888904-8ba2-30eb-90dc-c95ecfa98749",
                                                "text": "Lundi, l’enseigne de fast-food a convié la presse et une poignée d’influenceurs lors d’une « keynote » à Paris, pour annoncer en grande pompe son actualité de la rentrée : les nouvelles recettes de ses burgers stars."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12f32929-553b-42c0-97a7-2f62cae4d64f",
                                                "sense_id": "ec888904-8ba2-30eb-90dc-c95ecfa98749",
                                                "text": "Il ne faisait aucun doute que la poignée de musulmans restant sur l’île céderait, sous la pression d’offres financières acceptables, les dernières terres qui lui restaient […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bb39511b-9333-3820-9bd8-e0a40216df0e",
                                        "entry_id": "42fce56c-d864-319c-a71d-d219933d53bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Partie d’un objet par laquelle on le saisit avec la main."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01273a95-c4c2-4eba-a0a8-bdc0a664815e",
                                                "sense_id": "bb39511b-9333-3820-9bd8-e0a40216df0e",
                                                "text": "Alors avec un sang-froid extrême, le chasseur dégaina son couteau et l’enfonça jusqu’à la poignée dans le cœur de son ennemi."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d492c3ac-5141-4e4e-9f41-30350f240a5b",
                                                "sense_id": "bb39511b-9333-3820-9bd8-e0a40216df0e",
                                                "text": "— Eh bien, je vais me ramoner avec la poignée de votre brosse à cheveux et l'inonder d'un tel déluge de mouille que vous ne pourrez vous coiffer aujourd'hui."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "323e5ede-f216-3da7-9305-ea85228c5fd3",
                                        "entry_id": "42fce56c-d864-319c-a71d-d219933d53bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Partie d’un objet par laquelle on le saisit avec la main.",
                                            "Partie d’un matériel, d’un instrument de jeu, par laquelle on le saisit, qui permet de le manier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b12564d9-c496-31d3-bf06-50cbdd747e49",
                                        "entry_id": "42fce56c-d864-319c-a71d-d219933d53bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Morceau de tissu ou de cuir permettant de tenir un ustensile fort chaud, sans se brûler."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "687e8500-219d-32d1-9bc9-9ff8112c3634",
                                        "entry_id": "42fce56c-d864-319c-a71d-d219933d53bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pièce permettant d'avoir une action manuelle sur un organe mécanique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1143854f-dd59-4c55-953f-ad4cd063667a",
                                                "sense_id": "687e8500-219d-32d1-9bc9-9ff8112c3634",
                                                "text": "Une poignée de frein, d'accélération."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0031571a-666e-4e73-a683-38bb19ec62c6",
                                                "sense_id": "687e8500-219d-32d1-9bc9-9ff8112c3634",
                                                "text": "Alors, profitant de l'effet de surprise, je braque en direction de La Ferté-sur-Chiers et accélère en tournant au maximum la poignée des gaz."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ebfef728-02ed-3677-90f9-1dda66336347",
                                        "entry_id": "42fce56c-d864-319c-a71d-d219933d53bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Grand nombre d'atouts dans la main d'un joueur lors d'une partie de tarot qui permet d'obtenir un score bonus variant selon les versions (Elle peut être simple , double ou triple)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fcb83e9-d016-477d-8936-7b0368a506aa",
                                                "sense_id": "ebfef728-02ed-3677-90f9-1dda66336347",
                                                "text": "J’annonce une poignée simple."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
